# Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50): the last Horde visit of Stranglethorn and the
# Swamp of Sorrows, with a short trip back to Dustwallow Marsh, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/stranglethorn_vale_swamp_of_sorrows_50_50.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Stranglethorn Vale, area
# 33; Swamp of Sorrows, area 8). The quest list is section 14 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md:
# the last Mastery quests of Nesingwary, the Bloodsail captains, Captain Smotts and Negolash, the
# messages in bottles, the OOX reward, Cortello's riddles, the Swamp Talker and the Fallen Hero, and
# the challenge of Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall.
# Carried from earlier guides (skipped by those who lack them): Deliver to MacKinley (2874, Stoley in
# Tanaris), Report Back to Fizzlebub (1122, Kravel Koalbeard in Thousand Needles), Whiskey Slim's
# Lost Grog (580, taken in Booty Bay, its port found in the Hinterlands), Return to Fel'Zerul (1444,
# the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands) and the three OOX rescues (2767 Feralas, 648 Tanaris, 836 the
# Hinterlands), handed in to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay before An OOX of Your Own, and Grim Message
# (2932, taken from Nimboya at Grom'gol in Stranglethorn Vale (46-47), its pike planted in the
# Hinterlands), handed back to Nimboya as the zeppelin lands at Grom'gol.
# Class quests for warriors: A Troubled Spirit (8417, Sorek in Orgrimmar) is handed in to the Fallen
#   Hero of the Horde, who gives Warrior Kinship (8423, Helboars in the Blasted Lands), left to the
#   next guide.
# Cortello's Riddle (626) is left out: its treasure is in the Hinterlands, which no later guide visits.
# Data fixed here: State Secrets (96379) is taken without More Valuable Than Gold (96337), a quest of
#   the Alcaz Prison dungeon whose reward is the Document Box that State Secrets wants. Only ATT links
#   them. Neither Wowhead (WoW Forever, quest 96379: no series, no comments) nor outof.games (96379:
#   no prerequisite, only level 48) gives State Secrets a quest before it, though outof.games' page
#   of 96337 shows the three State Secrets (Rix Xizzix 96379, Nazgrel 96376, Renzik 96377) after it
#   in its chain. No comment on Wowhead's 96337 or 96379 says whether Rix offers it without 96337:
#   not confirmed either way. The Document Box is not bound: outof.games lists 26 of them on the Horde
#   auction house (about 27 gold, November 23 2026) and a vendor pays 25 gold for it, so a box bought
#   for nothing costs about 2 gold. The steps say so.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house) and the zeppelin to Grom'gol (Nimboya); Nesingwary's camp for
# Tethis and King Bangalash; Booty Bay and a loop south (Mok'rash, the Bloodsail ships, Negolash, the
# beaches and Jaguero Isle); a flight to Stonard and a loop through the Swamp (the Swamp Talker, the
# Fallen Hero, the bridge); the flight and zeppelin to Orgrimmar and on to Brackenwall Village for
# Mok'Morokk and the second riddle; the hearthstone back to Stonard for the Blasted Lands.

guide Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (50-50)
faction horde
levels 50 50
carry 580 1122 1444 2874 2932 3568 3908 4120
leave 3568 3908 4120 8423
next Blasted Lands (50-51)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
ah 96379.1 npc 8673
tip State Secrets, in Booty Bay, wants a Document Box: no mob in these zones drops it, so buy one here (about 27 gold, more than the quest pays). Rix may offer the quest only to those who found the box themselves: if he doesn't, a vendor buys the box back for 25 gold. Skip State Secrets if you would rather keep the gold.
note "Buy 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings at the auction house, for Negolash (optional)" npc 8673
tip Negolash only comes when someone puts 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 Junglevine Wine (sold in Booty Bay) in Captain Smotts' lifeboat. One of you brings them. A cook can make the wings from Buzzard Wings with the recipe instead. No wings? Skip Facing Negolash.
accept 8417
tip Warriors only: Sorek, the warrior trainer in the Valley of Honor, sends you to the Fallen Hero of the Horde in the Swamp of Sorrows.

# Nesingwary's camp ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Stranglethorn Vale
goto "Take the zeppelin from the towers outside Orgrimmar's gate to Grom'gol Base Camp" at 31.5,29.4 r 30
turnin 2932
tip Nimboya stands in Grom'gol, a few steps from the zeppelin tower.
accept 197
tip Ride north from Grom'gol to Nesingwary's camp.
do 197
tip Tethis is a level 43 elite raptor that spawns at one of three spots north-west of the Gurubashi Arena (around 31,43, 28,43 or 31,40, by a broken wagon). Clear the pairs of raptors around first. His Tendon Rip slows you, but he can be slowed and feared too.
turnin 197
accept 208
do 208
tip King Bangalash, a level 43 elite white tiger, stands among the bones on the hilltop at about 38,34. Clear the panthers around the hill first. At half health he calls two tigers, and they stay if you fail, with two more each new try: make the first attempt count.
turnin 208

# Booty Bay -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Booty Bay, Stranglethorn" npc 1387
turnin 2874
tip "Sea Wolf" MacKinley is inside the inn.
turnin 1122
turnin 580
tip Crank Fizzlebub and Whiskey Slim are on the ground floor of the inn.
accept 608
tip Fleet Master Seahorn is up on the balcony of the inn.
accept 3721
turnin 3721
accept 96379 nopre
tip Not offered? Rix may want you to have found the box yourself in the Alcaz Prison. Sell the box to a vendor for 25 gold and skip this quest.
do 96379 at 28.5,75.8 icon text "Give Rix Xizzix the Document Box"
turnin 96379
note "Buy 5 Junglevine Wine from Nixxrax Fillamug at the bar of the inn (only if you have the wings)" npc 2832

# Mok'rash and Captain Smotts -----------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 8552 at 23.3,72.1 "Kill Mok'rash for the Monogrammed Sash, then read it"
tip Mok'rash is a level 50 elite ogre who walks the shore just north-west of Booty Bay. He hits hard but can be feared and slowed: keep him at range, kite him around the goblin statue, or pull him back to the Booty Bay guards once he is well hurt. He respawns slowly: skip him if he isn't up.
turnin 8552
accept 8553
turnin 8553
accept 8554

# The Bloodsail ships -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

do 608.2
tip Each captain waits in the back room one staircase down (no deeper) in his own Bloodsail ship south of Booty Bay: Keelhaul in the western ship, Firallon in the middle one, Stillwater in the lone eastern one. The crews respawn fast, flee when hurt, and the swabbies' Gouge drops a pet's hold on them.
do 608.3
do 608.1
accept 624 at 30.6,90.2 "Find Cortello's Riddle, a rolled-up scroll below deck on one of the ships, and read it"
tip The scroll lies below deck on one ship only, often Stillwater's lone eastern ship: look on each as you clear it.

# Negolash, the beaches and Jaguero Isle ------------------------------------------------------------

do 8554
tip Click Captain Smotts' Ruined Lifeboat (around 32,82, a little bump of the Bloodsail beach before the first tent) and put in the 10 wings and 5 wines: Negolash, a level 52 elite giant, wades in from the north. He can be pulled to the Booty Bay guards, as long as the two of you do most of the damage. If the cutlass drops for only one of you, the other needs another set of wings and wine.
accept 594 at 36.6,77.1 "Open Half-Buried Bottles on the beach until one holds a Carefully Folded Note, then read it"
tip The small green bottles lie at the water's edge along the beaches east of Booty Bay. Several kinds of note come out of them: only the Carefully Folded Note starts the quest, and each of you needs one.
turnin 594
tip Princess Poobah stands on a small hill in the north-east of Jaguero Isle (around 38,80). Level 50 beasts roam the isle, stealthed panthers among them; none follows you into the sea.
accept 630
do 630
tip King Mukla is a level 50 elite ape on the south of the isle. He fears: clear the apes around him first, so a fear doesn't run you into them.
turnin 630

# Booty Bay -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 608
turnin 8554

# Stonard -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Stonard, Swamp of Sorrows" npc 2858
map Swamp of Sorrows
turnin 1444
tip Fel'zerul is upstairs in the great hall.
accept 2623
bind 6930

# The Swamp Talker, the Fallen Hero and the bridge --------------------------------------------------

do 2623
tip The Swamp Talker is in Stagalbog Cave (its mouth is near 66,76): keep right inside, to the room at the back (around 62,89), where he stands with two or three murlocs and calls more, one at a time.
turnin 2623
tip The Fallen Hero of the Horde stands alone in the south-west of the swamp.
accept 2801
do 2801 icon talk "Listen to the Fallen Hero of the Horde tell his tale"
turnin 2801
turnin 8417
tip Warriors only.
accept 8423
tip Seven Helboars, in the Blasted Lands: the next guide kills them among the boars it hunts, and brings this back to the Fallen Hero on its way.
turnin 624
tip The Soggy Scroll is under water, below the bridge on the road west to Deadwind Pass.
accept 625

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Grom'gol, Stranglethorn" npc 6026
note "Take the zeppelin at Grom'gol to Orgrimmar" at 31.5,29.4 in Stranglethorn_Vale
map Orgrimmar
train 3353 3352 3327 6018 3344 5885 3326
tip Paladins and druids have no trainer here: paladins train in Undercity or Thunder Bluff, druids in Thunder Bluff.
ah 2603.1 npc 8673 "Buy 14 Vulture Gizzards at the auction house, for the Blasted Lands (optional)"
tip The Blasted Lands guide comes next: its vultures are few and spread over the whole zone, and its three quests that want gizzards need 14.
ah 2601.1 npc 8673 "Buy 11 Basilisk Brains at the auction house, for the Blasted Lands (optional)"
ah 3501.1 npc 8673
ah 4449.2 npc 8673 "Buy 15 Silk Cloth at the auction house, for the Searing Gorge (optional)"
tip The outhouse prisoner in the Searing Gorge guide wants 15 Silk Cloth from each of you, and silk drops slowly there. Silk you already carry counts: take any from your bank.
fly "Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh" npc 3310

# Brackenwall Village and the riddle cave -----------------------------------------------------------

map Dustwallow Marsh
accept 1173
do 1173 at 36.4,31.4 mobs 4500 icon kill "Fight Overlord Mok'Morokk until he gives up"
tip He is a level 45 elite but hits like a much bigger one (crits near 800) and has lots of health; he turns on you as soon as you accept and yields at about a third of his health. He can be feared, rooted and kited: keep him off whoever is weakest.
turnin 1173
tip Draz'Zilb is in the small cave at the south end of the village.
turnin 625
tip The Musty Scroll lies on a rock inside a small cave in the south-west of the marsh. Mobs respawn fast there: be quick.

# Back to Stonard -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

hearth npc 6930
note "Ride south out of Stonard along the road into the Blasted Lands for the next guide" npc 6930
